#      1 uses potions: cure, heal, Refresh and the stat potions.
#
#   config__walk_guard
#      Our casts and the walk bar.
#        0  cast while walking, for a fight where there is no better moment to wait for
#        1  wait while the walk bar runs, so a step does not break the cast
#
#   config__warmode_is_manual
#      Whose warmode it is.
#        0  ours: our casts ignore it
#        1  the player's manual control window: our casts and the food stand down while it
#           is on. Potions and bandages still go out
#      > This loop: config__warmode_is_manual 1 (default 0).
#      > Warmode is the player's: recovery casts and buffs stand down, potions still go out.
#
#   config__recover_in_warmode
#      With warmode_is_manual 1, what the recovery casts (cure, heal, light Heal) do in
#      warmode.
#        0  stand down with the rest
#        1  keep going, so only the other casts wait for the player
